---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

// Homepage v12. Everything below lives inside .home-v12 and its stylesheet is
// scoped to that class, so none of the prototype's element-level rules (body,
// h1-h3, p, a, img, .container, .section) can reach product or guide pages.
// The header and footer are NOT here — Layout renders the shared components.
// Review notes that used to sit in the template as HTML comments, and so were
// served in the page source until removed:
//
//   Five hero-stat cards use copy supplied verbatim by the user for this local draft. Figures ha
//   ve not been independently verified. "20+ Patents & IP" is not a verified count of granted pa
//   tents; the separate five-patent statement in About retains its original narrower scope. No s
//   tructured data or production pages were updated.
//
//   Sources: src/pages/index.astro company and enquiry copy; src/pages/products/static-eliminato
//   r/st-g-series.astro product selection, made-to-order lengths, mounting drawings, emitter cle
//   aning access, power connections and measurement guidance. No delivery, performance or free-s
//   ervice guarantees are introduced.
//
//   Source: src/pages/index.astro, About Shidike cards and Certifications section. Founded 2013;
//    in-house design, assembly and testing; four utility model patents and one design patent gra
//   nted in China for cleaning and dust-removal equipment. Six displayed document scopes follow 
//   the original certificate-image alt text. All four original company photos and all six unique
//    certificate images are included.

// The first paragraph used to open "Founded in Dongguan in 2013". Per the owner the
// 2013 business was opened in Suzhou / East China, and the Dongguan operation only
// took the Shidike name in the last couple of years - so that sentence was wrong on
// both the place and what 2013 refers to. It now states where the equipment is made
// and leaves the timeline to the paragraph below.
//
// STILL UNRESOLVED, needs the owner: the Organization/LocalBusiness JSON-LD in
// Layout.astro carries foundingDate "2013" against legalName "Dongguan Shidike
// Intelligent Equipment Co., Ltd.". If that entity was registered recently rather
// than in 2013, the structured data is asserting a checkable date that is wrong.
// Do not guess it - get the registration date off the licence.

// Company background, from the owner. NOT for the rendered page - this block is a
// frontmatter comment on purpose, because HTML comments in the template are served
// to the browser and this must not be.
//
// The earlier companies are deliberately unnamed in the copy. The predecessor is
// still on the register and has proceedings against it, and the owner was its
// shareholder and legal representative, so naming it publicly would hand anyone
// running a background check a direct route from Shidike to those proceedings. It
// buys nothing either: a buyer wants the years in the trade, not a former name.
//
// For the same reason none of that company's assets appear anywhere on this site -
// its trademark, its industry-association memberships and its certification firsts
// belong to it, not to Shidike.
//
// "since 2005" is anchored on the year the owner became a shareholder and legal
// representative of a company in this same trade. That is what supports the "20+
// Years" figure in the stat cards (2005-2026 = 21). It is not a founding date for
// Shidike, which is 2013.

const base = 'https://www.dg-sdk.com';
